              description:
                'Bananas are one of our favorite snack foods, and for good reason. It\'s easy to take this humble fruit to the next level with some of our favorite banana recipes. This <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/dark-chocolate-peanut-butter-banana-protein-smoothie">dark chocolate peanut butter smoothie</a> combines some delicious flavors and makes for a great on-the-go breakfast. Or go wild for this rich and creamy <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/banana-pudding">banana pudding</a> or our <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/chocolate-banana-cream-sandwiches">banana cream sandwiches</a>. ',
