              description:
                "We think it's time for s'more s'mores (just humor us, please). Get State Fair ready with our S'mores <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/s-mores-funnel-cake-fries\">Funnel Cake Fries</a> and if those don't satisfy your cravings, chase 'em down with a gooey and melty S'mores <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/skillet-brownie-smores\">Skillet Brownie</a>! It's summer time. It's grill time. It's time for...s'more. That's right. ",
